Input: {"question": "In which significant event was Navigation device with adaptive fixed pattern noise update and operating method thereof involved?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 93, "text": "**The Quest for Accurate Navigation: Unraveling the Mystery of Adaptive Fixed Pattern Noise**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 95, "end": 157, "text": "In the realm of navigation technology, precision is paramount."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 158, "end": 294, "text": "A slight miscalculation can lead to catastrophic consequences, making it essential to continually refine and improve navigation systems."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 295, "end": 536, "text": "One such innovation that has revolutionized the industry is the \"Navigation device with adaptive fixed pattern noise update and operating method thereof,\" a groundbreaking invention that has left an indelible mark on the world of navigation."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 537, "end": 789, "text": "At the heart of this remarkable technology lies the concept of adaptive fixed pattern noise update, a sophisticated approach that enables navigation devices to dynamically adjust to environmental changes, ensuring unparalleled accuracy and reliability."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 790, "end": 1005, "text": "This pioneering invention has been instrumental in shaping the course of navigation history, and its significance is underscored by its involvement in a significant event filing, as documented in US patent 11128825."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1006, "end": 1187, "text": "To fully appreciate the magnitude of this achievement, it is essential to delve into the intricacies of navigation technology and the challenges that have long plagued the industry."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1188, "end": 1387, "text": "For decades, navigation devices have struggled to overcome the limitations imposed by fixed pattern noise, a phenomenon that arises from the inherent imperfections in sensor design and manufacturing."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1388, "end": 1494, "text": "This noise can lead to errors in navigation data, compromising the accuracy and reliability of the system."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1495, "end": 1672, "text": "The inventors of the \"Navigation device with adaptive fixed pattern noise update and operating method thereof\" recognized the need for a paradigm shift in navigation technology."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1673, "end": 1839, "text": "They embarked on a quest to develop a system that could adapt to the ever-changing environment, dynamically updating its noise patterns to ensure optimal performance."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1840, "end": 2021, "text": "Through tireless research and experimentation, they succeeded in creating a navigation device that could learn from its surroundings, refining its accuracy with each passing moment."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2022, "end": 2159, "text": "The operating method of this innovative device is rooted in advanced algorithms that continuously monitor and analyze environmental data."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2160, "end": 2357, "text": "By detecting subtle changes in temperature, humidity, and other factors, the device can update its fixed pattern noise in real-time, ensuring that its navigation data remains accurate and reliable."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2358, "end": 2533, "text": "This adaptive approach enables the device to compensate for the limitations of its sensors, effectively mitigating the impact of fixed pattern noise on navigation performance."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2534, "end": 2590, "text": "The significance of this invention cannot be overstated."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2591, "end": 2790, "text": "By providing a navigation device that can adapt to its environment, the inventors have opened up new possibilities for a wide range of applications, from autonomous vehicles to precision agriculture."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2791, "end": 2917, "text": "The implications are far-reaching, with the potential to transform industries and revolutionize the way we navigate our world."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 87, "text": "**BREAKING: Revolutionary Navigation Tech Plays Crucial Role in Army Recruit Training**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 89, "end": 309, "text": "In a groundbreaking development, the US Army has revealed that its latest navigation device, equipped with adaptive fixed pattern noise update technology, has been instrumental in the successful training of new recruits."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 310, "end": 500, "text": "The innovative device, patented under US patent 11128825, has been hailed as a game-changer in military navigation, allowing soldiers to navigate complex terrain with unprecedented accuracy."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 501, "end": 665, "text": "According to sources within the Army, the device was first introduced to the training program six months ago, and the results have been nothing short of remarkable."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 666, "end": 840, "text": "\"We've seen a significant reduction in navigation errors and a marked improvement in overall performance,\" said Captain James Reed, Training Officer at Fort Benning, Georgia."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 841, "end": 1037, "text": "\"The adaptive fixed pattern noise update feature has been particularly effective in simulating real-world scenarios, allowing our recruits to develop the skills they need to succeed in the field.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1038, "end": 1215, "text": "The device's advanced algorithm, which continuously updates and adapts to changing environmental conditions, has proven to be a major advantage in the Army's training exercises."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1216, "end": 1386, "text": "\"In the past, we've had issues with recruits getting disoriented in dense forests or urban environments,\" explained Sergeant Rachel Martinez, a seasoned drill instructor."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1387, "end": 1494, "text": "\"But with this new technology, they're able to navigate even the most challenging terrain with confidence.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1495, "end": 1656, "text": "Data released by the Army shows that recruits who have used the device have demonstrated a 35% improvement in navigation accuracy compared to those who have not."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1657, "end": 1773, "text": "Furthermore, the device has been credited with reducing the average completion time for navigation exercises by 20%."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1774, "end": 1944, "text": "One recruit, Private First Class Emily Chen, who recently completed her training at Fort Leonard Wood, Missouri, praised the device for its ease of use and effectiveness."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1945, "end": 2050, "text": "\"I was skeptical at first, but once I got used to the device, I found it incredibly intuitive,\" she said."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2051, "end": 2143, "text": "\"It really helped me to stay focused and on track, even in the most challenging situations.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2144, "end": 2271, "text": "The Army's adoption of this cutting-edge technology is seen as a significant step forward in modernizing its training programs."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2272, "end": 2408, "text": "As the military continues to evolve and adapt to new threats and challenges, the importance of accurate navigation cannot be overstated."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2409, "end": 2632, "text": "With the Navigation device with adaptive fixed pattern noise update and operating method thereof, the US Army is ensuring that its soldiers have the tools they need to succeed in an increasingly complex and uncertain world."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "US patent 11128825", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Navigation device with adaptive fixed pattern noise update and operating method thereof", "scope": "involvement in a significant event", "claim": "The Navigation device with adaptive fixed pattern noise update and operating method thereof was involved in a significant event filing documented in US patent 11128825.", "answer": "US patent 11128825", "quote": "This pioneering invention has been instrumental in shaping the course of navigation history, and its significance is underscored by its involvement in a significant event filing, as documented in US patent 11128825.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["US patent 11128825"]}
